{"translation":{"id":"cmn_cuv","name":"新標點和合本","website":"https://ebible.org/Scriptures/details.php?id=cmn-cu89t","licenseUrl":"https://ebible.org/Scriptures/details.php?id=cmn-cu89t","licenseNotes":null,"shortName":"CUV","englishName":"Chinese Union Version (traditional)","language":"cmn","textDirection":"ltr","sha256":"923f114ccc6ab7fc558e054f84df5214fa9782ca7c02882cf173417a0d1d641e","availableFormats":["json"],"listOfBooksApiLink":"/api/cmn_cuv/books.json","numberOfBooks":66,"totalNumberOfChapters":1189,"totalNumberOfVerses":31021,"languageName":"中文","languageEnglishName":"Chinese"},"book":{"id":"2JN","translationId":"cmn_cuv","name":"約翰二書","commonName":"約翰二書","title":"約翰二書","order":63,"numberOfChapters":1,"sha256":"6401acc2cb18f7aa025f59e7e170f7a7e02affffe5207914522dde3b22efcc47","firstChapterNumber":1,"firstChapterApiLink":"/api/cmn_cuv/2JN/1.json","lastChapterNumber":1,"lastChapterApiLink":"/api/cmn_cuv/2JN/1.json","totalNumberOfVerses":13},"chapter":{"number":1,"content":[{"type":"heading","content":["問候"]},{"type":"verse","number":1,"content":["作長老的寫信給蒙揀選的太太",{"noteId":0},"和她的兒女，就是我誠心所愛的；不但我愛，也是一切知道真理之人所愛的。"]},{"type":"verse","number":2,"content":["愛你們是為真理的緣故，這真理存在我們裏面，也必永遠與我們同在。"]},{"type":"verse","number":3,"content":["恩惠、憐憫、平安從父上帝和他兒子耶穌基督在真理和愛心上必常與我們同在！"]},{"type":"heading","content":["真理和愛"]},{"type":"verse","number":4,"content":["我見你的兒女，有照我們從父所受之命令遵行真理的，就甚歡喜。"]},{"type":"verse","number":5,"content":["太太啊，我現在勸你，我們大家要彼此相愛。這並不是我寫一條新命令給你，乃是我們從起初所受的命令。"]},{"type":"verse","number":6,"content":["我們若照他的命令行，這就是愛。你們從起初所聽見當行的，就是這命令。"]},{"type":"verse","number":7,"content":["因為世上有許多迷惑人的出來，他們不認耶穌基督是成了肉身來的；這就是那迷惑人、敵基督的。"]},{"type":"verse","number":8,"content":["你們要小心，不要失去你們",{"noteId":1},"所做的工，乃要得着滿足的賞賜。"]},{"type":"verse","number":9,"content":["凡越過基督的教訓不常守着的，就沒有上帝；常守這教訓的，就有父又有子。"]},{"type":"verse","number":10,"content":["若有人到你們那裏，不是傳這教訓，不要接他到家裏，也不要問他的安；"]},{"type":"verse","number":11,"content":["因為問他安的，就在他的惡行上有分。"]},{"type":"heading","content":["問安"]},{"type":"verse","number":12,"content":["我還有許多事要寫給你們，卻不願意用紙墨寫出來，但盼望到你們那裏，與你們當面談論，使你們的喜樂滿足。"]},{"type":"verse","number":13,"content":["你那蒙揀選之姊妹的兒女都問你安。"]}],"footnotes":[{"noteId":0,"caller":"-","text":"或譯：教會；下同","reference":{"chapter":1,"verse":1}},{"noteId":1,"caller":"-","text":"有古卷：我們","reference":{"chapter":1,"verse":8}}]},"thisChapterLink":"/api/cmn_cuv/2JN/1.json","thisChapterAudioLinks":{},"nextChapterApiLink":"/api/cmn_cuv/3JN/1.json","nextChapterAudioLinks":{},"previousChapterApiLink":"/api/cmn_cuv/1JN/5.json","previousChapterAudioLinks":{},"numberOfVerses":13}